{"id":"595437","name":"肉松芝心三明治","author":"鱼菲","authorId":"2270985","desc":"","cover":"images/595437/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生菜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"火龙果","amount":"少许"},{"name":"肉松","amount":"适量"},{"name":"咸蛋黄","amount":"2个"},{"name":"沙拉酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芝士片","amount":"1片"},{"name":"吐司","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/595437/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黄瓜切片备用。","img":"images/595437/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"火龙果切片备用。","img":"images/595437/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肉松与咸蛋黄混合，加入适量沙拉酱，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/595437/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"涂抹在两片吐司上。","img":"images/595437/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"依次放上黄瓜、火龙果、芝士片、生菜。","img":"images/595437/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用保鲜膜包裹住。","img":"images/595437/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再包上一层油纸。","img":"images/595437/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"对半切开即可。","img":"images/595437/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}